e inputs.\ndocs/design/dao.stream.md-202-\n--\ndocs/design/dao.stream.md-295-where `attach!` on the reconstructed value attaches to the stream it names —\ndocs/design/dao.stream.md-296-provided the receiving host can reach what it names at all (see Creation and\ndocs/design/dao.stream.md-297-Attachment on reachability), and allowing that a transport which cannot know\ndocs/design/dao.stream.md-298-that at call time reports it later as data.\ndocs/design/dao.stream.md-299-\ndocs/design/dao.stream.md-300-Both envelopes are plain data through and through: every value must survive\ndocs/design/dao.stream.md-301-the host serialization codec structurally unchanged, so equality is\ndocs/design/dao.stream.md-302-structural, and no key holds a function, a host object, a live handle, or\ndocs/design/dao.stream.md:303:identity smuggled in metadata. Like every DaoStream map, envelopes are open —\ndocs/design/dao.stream.md-304-a consumer ignores qualified keys it does not understand.\ndocs/design/dao.stream.md-305-\ndocs/design/dao.stream.md-306-`create!` outcomes:\ndocs/design/dao.stream.md-307-\ndocs/design/dao.stream.md-308-| Outcome                       | Meaning                                       | Required keys        |\ndocs/design/dao.stream.md-309-|-------------------------------|-----------------------------------------------|----------------------|\ndocs/design/dao.stream.md-310-| `:dao.stream/ok`              | A new logical stream exists, its identity settled at once. Implies not that every resource backing it has finished being acquired. | `:dao.stream/handle` |\ndocs/design/dao.stream.md-311-| `:dao.stream/invalid-spec`    | The creation specification is malformed.      | —                    |\ndocs/design/dao.stream.md-312-| `:dao.stream/not-found`       | No transport here matches `:dao.stream/type`. | —                    |\ndocs/design/dao.stream.md:313:| `:dao.stream/transport-error` | The handler failed.                           | —                    